Scope — code and art are licensed separately.

The MIT license above covers the CODE in this repository. It does not cover the
art. Every sprite and background comes from a third-party pack that keeps its
own license (all Creative Commons Zero 1.0 today), and none of those packs are
committed here — they are downloaded into the working tree and ignored by git.

The packs, their creators, links and licenses are listed in exactly one place,
`overfit/data/credits.json`; the game's credits screen and
`overfit/assets/LICENSES.md` both read from it.

위 MIT 는 이 저장소의 **코드**에 대한 것이다. 그림은 각 팩의 라이선스(지금은 전부 CC0 1.0)를
따르고, 원본은 저장소에 없다. 팩 목록은 `overfit/data/credits.json` 한 곳에 있다 —
게임의 크레딧 화면과 `overfit/assets/LICENSES.md` 가 그 파일을 가리킨다.
